    stateOfArt: ["First-line immunotherapy without chemotherapy in metastatic disease, with more than half of patients alive at five years in KEYNOTE-177.", "Neoadjuvant checkpoint blockade produces pathological complete response in most localised colon cancers (NICHE-2).", "Rectal cancer can be cured with a PD-1 antibody alone, without surgery or radiotherapy.", "Universal mismatch repair testing at diagnosis finds Lynch families."],
